  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kZtFs2s.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:8px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/Jake-E/Myrtrees/actions/workflows/build.yml/badge.svg\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:36px\"><strong>Myrtrees</strong></span></p><h5 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h5><h4 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>特色功能</strong></span></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li>全新自訂樹木 - 橡膠樹</li>\n<li>可使用樹木採集器從樹上採集乳膠</li>\n<li>新增可放置的水桶，用於收集從採集器滲出的乳膠</li>\n<li>乳膠物品，可從裝有足夠乳膠的水桶中收穫</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>遊戲截圖</strong></span></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/411/595/310/172/2021-11-30_14.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/411/596/310/172/2021-11-30_14.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/411/597/310/172/2021-11-30_14.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/411/598/310/172/2021-11-30_14.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/411/599/310/172/2021-11-30_14.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
